<title>JAPAN: Watami Food shares hit record high in Tokyo trade.</title>
<headline>Watami Food shares hit record high in Tokyo trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Watami Food Service Co Ltd soared to a record high on Tuesday afternoon on news of a planned share split, brokers said.</p>
<p>The company said that it planned a 1.5-for-1 share split on May 20, for shareholders as of March 31.</p>
<p>As of 0523 GMT, the shares were trading at 3,950 yen, up from Monday's level of 3,800 yen. The shares were registered on the over-the-counter market on February 21.</p>
